# The build context only needs kindi/ (copied into the image) and docker/ (the Dockerfiles). Everything here would
# otherwise be sent to the Docker daemon on every build - in particular `pack` (a symlink to the converted models)
# can be tens of GB, and `.git` the full history.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
models
pack
state
*.gguf
*.bin
*.npz
*.npy
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.log
kindi.conf
.vscode
.idea
